ah" width="4032" height="3024" loading="lazy"/><figcaption>Example photograph · <a href="/credits/#speaking">Delegate Connect / Commons</a></figcaption></figure><div class="owner-excerpt"><ul><li>I teach courses on technology, facilitate yoga classes, as well as lecture publically at request.</li><li>My primary occupation is consulting for individuals and companies on technology and systems development.</li></ul><a class="text-link" href="/about/">About Jah Noah</a></div><Connect kind="speaking" client:load/></article></section><section class="achievement"><p class="eyebrow">Congressional App Challenge · District winner</p><h2>Cybersecurity awareness, on Capitol Hill.</h2><p>Presented my cybersecurity-awareness game on Capitol Hill.</p><a class="text-link" href="/tech">Experience &amp; skills →</a><a class="text-link" href="/Journal">October · Cybersecurity Awareness Month →</a></section><section class="conversation-note"><p>I like to have relaxed, in-person conversations prior to any professional engagement. No matter how intense a situation may be, a calm, centered approach is most important.</p><Connect client:load/></section><section class="nature-strip" aria-label="Words &amp; nature"><figure class="nature-flowers"><img src="/images/flowers.webp" alt="A meadow of wildflowers" width="3553" height="2674" loading="lazy"/><blockquote><p>“collective upliftment is the only true path to individual success.”</p><cite>Jah Noah · <a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20240221075808/https://jahnoah.com/">2024 site · External</a></cite></blockquote><figcaption><a href="/credits/#flowers">Photograph credits</a></figcaption></figure><figure class="nature-dragonfly"><img src="/images/dragonfly.webp" alt="Dragonfly perched on a twig" width="1280" height="859" loading="lazy"/><blockquote><p>“Prayer is cool water that cools the heart.”</p><cite><a href="https://etcsl.orinst.ox.ac.uk/section5/tr561.htm">The Instructions of Shuruppag · Oxford ETCSL translation · Lines 134–142 · External</a></cite></blockquote><figcaption><a href="/credits/#dragonfly">Photograph credits</a></figcaption></figure><figure class="nature-rainbow"><img src="/images/rainbow.webp" alt="Rainbow across the sky" width="1280" height="1138" loading="lazy"/><blockquote><p>“We all have profound wisdom to share, so the more people catch on that they may share their light bright and long, the better.”</p><cite>Jah Noah · <a href="/Journal/share-their-light/">Journal excerpt</a></cite></blockquote><figcaption><a href="/credits/#rainbow">Photograph credits</a></figcaption></figure></section><section class="home-journal"><header><h2><a href="/Journal/">Journal</a></h2><TopicLinks/></header><JournalList kind="Archived original"/><a class="text-link" href="/Journal/">All journal entries →</a></section></Base>